OL,3,GNEWSAWoman badly hurt in mobility
OL,4,Ascooter and van crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 80s was seriously
OL,7,Finjured when her mobility scooter was
OL,8,Fhit by a van at a pedestrian crossing,
OL,9,Fpolice said.
OL,11,FThe incident happened on Baldock High
OL,12,FStreet, near Pinnock Lane, at about
OL,13,F16:00 BST on Friday and involved a
OL,14,Fsilver Ford Transit Connect.
OL,16,FHertfordshire Police said a 40-year-old
OL,17,Fman from Northampton had been arrested
OL,18,Fon suspicion of causing serious injury
OL,19,Fby careless driving, driving without
OL,20,Finsurance and driving while not wearing
OL,21,Fa seatbelt.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
